==== Serial ====
-> [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial]] general information about the serial port, serial port cable, etc.

There is an unfilled five-pin header labeled JP1 which is a 3.3V TTL [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial|serial port]]. Experimentation with an oscilloscope indicates that it runs at 115200 8N1, but I'm waiting on the arrival of my serial adapter to verify. I believe this is the correct pinout, but I'm not certain about RxD and NC.

